# Jak 3's effects on the simulated headset (LIST-0.1.5 items 13 to 15; the owner: "jak 2 and 3 have issues with
# certain affects putting a colored square in front of your face ... in jak 3 1 of the red guns puts a black 1 out every
# time you shoot it", "jak 3 has skybox z-fighting", and Vixel: "the 1 that makes you dark jak seems not to work"), run
# with JAKVR_TEST_GUN=all (every gun, Dark Jak's and Light Jak's meters full) JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1 JAKVR_SKY_TRACE=1:
# into play in the desert after the opening (as jak3_gun.sim), the sky looked at around (item 15's pictures, with the
# sky trace's depth lines), then the gun drawn and the d-pad (the left thumb on its rest) up three times, each red gun
# fired at the ground by his feet and ahead, pictures 2, 4, 12 and 40 frames after; one gun of each other color, the
# dark three; then Dark Jak by the left stick's click (the gun drawn: the click is L2), his punch and dive, and later
# Light Jak by the left grip's quick squeeze, squeezed again and held, with X (slow time) and then B (his shield).
# Expect "[vr-pad] the left grip" lines, target-powerjak-get-on, and in the -panel pictures nothing but the HUD.
